*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : WA3096
* Inductance = 22nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 100kHz-3GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor TLine Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt WA3096 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.175pF
X1 port1 port2 Model3A PARAMS:
+ R1=20
+ R2=0.0025
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000094
+ L_Z0=330
+ L_EL=37
+ L_F0=1500E6
.ends WA3096

